lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn the office, Xiao Gang, Xiao Li, and Xiao Zhang face the final deadline of the project. Xiao Li always works overtime, hoping to get the manager's approval. Xiao Zhang often leaves early, and the work he hands in is not satisfactory. Today, the manager suddenly comes to the office, Xiao Li immediately throws himself into work, Xiao Zhang picks up his mobile phone pretending to handle work calls. Xiao Gang sees all this, he looks at his watch, then quietly continues his work. Xiao Li gives a report to the manager, the manager looks at the report, nods his head, looks at Xiao Zhang who is on the phone, doesn't say anything and leaves. Xiao Gang seems to have something to say, but he just takes a deep breath and continues to work.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Xiao Gang just take a deep breath and continue to work?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Gang thinks his work is the most important and does not want to pay attention to other things.\nB. Xiao Gang thinks the manager favors Xiao Zhang.\nC. Xiao Gang does not want to be pointed at by others.\nD. Xiao Gang hopes to leave early with Xiao Zhang.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008576888501221729,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58acf9aa9dc5a833d52f4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794476751565,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:45:51","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"778df534f8ad4206a77808933307617d"}